<div class="ph-cat-group">   <p class="ph-kicker">Living collections</p>   <h2 class="ph-h3">Explore our plant collections</h2>   <p class="ph-copy">Choose a collection to explore plant species and the sizes listed in our online store.</p>   <div class="ph-product-grid ph-category-grid">     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_palm_trees }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419436">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419436" role="img" aria-label="Palm Trees"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Palm Trees</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Architectural palms. Open this collection to reach species such as Washingtonia robusta.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View species</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_trees }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419439">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419439" role="img" aria-label="Trees"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Trees</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Shade, avenue and specimen trees for design-led planting.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_rare_trees }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419442">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419442" role="img" aria-label="Large, Rare and Ancient Trees"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Large, Rare &amp; Ancient Trees</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Heritage olives and monumental specimens with documented character.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_cacti }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419445">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419445" role="img" aria-label="Cacti and Succulents"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Cacti &amp; Succulents</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Sculptural desert forms, including yucca and monumental cacti.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_indoor }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419448">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419448" role="img" aria-label="Indoor Ornamental Plants"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Indoor Ornamental Plants</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Interior specimens for hospitality, residences and workplaces.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_shrubs }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419454">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419454" role="img" aria-label="Shrubs and Ground Cover"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Shrubs &amp; Ground Cover</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Mass planting, edges and ground plane for complete schemes.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_climbers }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419457">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419457" role="img" aria-label="Climbers"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Climbers</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Vertical greening for walls, pergolas and architectural screens.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_flowers }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419460">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419460" role="img" aria-label="Fresh Flowers and Bouquets"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <p class="ph-kicker">Collection</p>         <h3 class="ph-h3">Fresh Flowers &amp; Bouquets</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Cut flowers and arrangements for events and hospitality.</p>         <span class="ph-more">View collection</span>       </div>     </a>   </div> </div>  <div class="ph-cat-group ph-cat-group-support">   <p class="ph-kicker">Nursery support</p>   <h2 class="ph-h3">Garden supplies and more</h2>   <p class="ph-copy">Explore additional nursery supplies and contact our team to confirm availability for your project.</p>   <div class="ph-product-grid ph-category-grid">     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_artificial }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419451">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419451" role="img" aria-label="Artificial Plants"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <h3 class="ph-h3">Artificial Plants</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Botanical forms for controlled or interior settings.</p>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_seeds }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419463">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419463" role="img" aria-label="Seeds and Planting Stock"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <h3 class="ph-h3">Seeds &amp; Planting Stock</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Propagation material and grow-to-order stock.</p>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_fertilizers }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419466">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419466" role="img" aria-label="Fertilizers and Soil Amendments"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <h3 class="ph-h3">Fertilizers &amp; Soil Amendments</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Soil and nutrition for establishment and aftercare.</p>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_art }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419469">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419469" role="img" aria-label="Art and Sculptures"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <h3 class="ph-h3">Art &amp; Sculptures</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Sculpture and art for gardens and public spaces.</p>       </div>     </a>     <a class="ph-product-card" href="{{ ph_url_tools }}" data-ph-cat-id="1149036000001419472">       <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-cat-photo="1149036000001419472" role="img" aria-label="Tools and Equipment"></div>       <div class="ph-card-body">         <h3 class="ph-h3">Tools &amp; Equipment</h3>         <p class="ph-copy">Nursery tools, consumables and direct purchases.</p>       </div>     </a>   </div> </div> 